	(text "For TIA2, the ground node is on a separate\nboard, possibly with a slightly different\npotential. Connect AIN_GND to ground of that\nboard instead of the current board.\n\nFor TIA1, connect the ADC end of the coaxial\ncable (if present) to the main board. In this\ncase, AIN_GND should connect to GND of the main board."
